{"name": "Tomb Guard", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You Can't Kill What's Already Dead</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tomb Guard is a challenging real-time with pause party tactics game, where you can expect to die. A lot. Fortunately, this band of skeletons has access to resurrection magic from those whom they call \u201cThe Makers\u201d. Unfortunately, this resurrection magic is why their cozy town of Tombstead was attacked by The Order. A cult of Fiends who want revenge against The Makers and their skeletons.<br/><br/>Take the fight to the Order and drive them away from Tombstead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757780/extras/b6043dcff1e9e3bf8c037751c8430b30.poster.avif?t=1789433524\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757780/extras/b6043dcff1e9e3bf8c037751c8430b30.webm?t=1789433524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757780/extras/b6043dcff1e9e3bf8c037751c8430b30.mp4?t=1789433524\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Pause, Strategize, Attack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pause the battle at any time to strategize against overwhelming odds and overpowering foes. Line up attacks and skills, then unpause to watch the onslaught unfold.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757780/extras/2175d743e80a7013ab4cc36bfd1bc170.poster.avif?t=1789433524\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757780/extras/2175d743e80a7013ab4cc36bfd1bc170.webm?t=1789433524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757780/extras/2175d743e80a7013ab4cc36bfd1bc170.mp4?t=1789433524\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gather Your Party</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control a party of 4 skeletons from 8 unlockable classes. Upgrade their skills and select specializations to prepare your skeletons for difficult fights and hard-won challenges.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757780/extras/76232bababdd9149a90ef48ca71b7fe3.poster.avif?t=1789433524\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757780/extras/76232bababdd9149a90ef48ca71b7fe3.webm?t=1789433524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757780/extras/76232bababdd9149a90ef48ca71b7fe3.mp4?t=1789433524\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Epic Fights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle your way through room after room until you reach a Lord of the Order. These are no ordinary Fiends and require the utmost skill and preparation to defeat!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757780/extras/c7c6937092517008acf620aef522c02e.poster.avif?t=1789433524\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757780/extras/c7c6937092517008acf620aef522c02e.webm?t=1789433524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757780/extras/c7c6937092517008acf620aef522c02e.mp4?t=1789433524\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Battle Across the Land</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757780/extras/f9b2a58a295401db6776d0246dc7e4cc.poster.avif?t=1789433524\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757780/extras/f9b2a58a295401db6776d0246dc7e4cc.webm?t=1789433524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757780/extras/f9b2a58a295401db6776d0246dc7e4cc.mp4?t=1789433524\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll take on The Order and their minions across ruins, swamps, and uninhabitable wastes. The skeletons will have to venture far from their cozy home of Tombstead if they wish to protect it.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Collect Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757780/extras/ce3c54209191fda1ce32a45c3dc3c7c9.poster.avif?t=1789433524\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757780/extras/ce3c54209191fda1ce32a45c3dc3c7c9.webm?t=1789433524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757780/extras/ce3c54209191fda1ce32a45c3dc3c7c9.mp4?t=1789433524\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience events and complete challenges to unlock over a 100 weapons, armors, items, and blessings that make every run different! But be warned, every potential reward comes with a risk\u2026  </p> </div>", "short_desc": "Tomb Guard is a real-time with pause tactics game. You control a band of skeletons as they defend their homeland from the invading Fiends. Focus is key, for facing overwhelming odds is certain. Pause, strategize, and attack to protect Tombstead and defeat The Order once and for all.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757780/8059083e145f030a4a5eddf28c081692748dbad2/header.jpg?t=1789433524", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Tactical", "Real-Time with Pause", "Roguelite", "Strategy RPG", "Dark Fantasy", "Difficult"], "developers": "Studio Siege", "publishers": "Studio Siege", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3757780", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "14 September 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/Rv_r_As1aHM", "first_seen": 1789336800.0, "review_rank": 63}